# Blog view counter (Redis REST). Without these, the counter simply hides.
# Create a database in Vercel -> Storage -> Redis (or upstash.com). Vercel
# auto-adds these to the project; for local dev copy them into .env.local.
# The code accepts EITHER pair below (whichever your integration provides):
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
